---
// BrushLLM brand mark: cinnabar tile + open ink ring (enso)
---
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
  <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true">
    <rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" class="fill-accent"></rect>
    <circle
      cx="16"
      cy="16"
      r="8"
      fill="none"
      stroke="#fff"
      stroke-width="3.2"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-dasharray="38 12.3"
      transform="rotate(45 16 16)"></circle>
  </svg>
  <span class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Brush<span class="text-accent">LLM</span></span>
</span>
